---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="Digitali refund policy for downloadable digital products: when refunds apply, how to request one, and your statutory rights."
  path="/refund-policy"
>
  <section class="section-tight legal">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width: 780px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Refund Policy</h1>

      <div class="draft-banner" role="note">
        <strong>DRAFT — owner must review before launch.</strong> This is a
        plain-language draft, not legal advice. Refund handling must also comply
        with Lemon Squeezy's seller terms and applicable consumer law in the
        buyer's jurisdiction. Items marked [MERCHANT CONFIG] must be completed.
        Last updated: October 2026.
      </div>

      <h2>The honest reality of digital goods</h2>
      <p>
        Our products are downloadable files. Once downloaded, a file cannot be
        "returned" the way a physical item can. Our policy below tries to be fair
        while reflecting that reality — and it never overrides rights granted to
        you by applicable consumer law.
      </p>

      <h2>14-day refund window</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          If you have <strong>not downloaded</strong> the product files, you may
          request a full refund within <strong>14 days</strong> of purchase.
        </li>
        <li>
          If you <strong>have downloaded</strong> the files, refunds are granted
          only where the product is materially not as described or is technically
          defective and we cannot fix it within a reasonable time.
        </li>
        <li>
          The free demo exists so you can evaluate the product before buying —
          please use it.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How to request a refund</h2>
      <p>
        Contact us within the window above with your order details
        (info.cosmicragsltd@gmail.com). Refunds, when approved, are issued
        through Lemon Squeezy to the original payment method.
      </p>

      <h2>Statutory rights</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing in this policy limits any statutory rights you may have under
        applicable law, including EU/UK consumer rights for digital content.
        Where the law requires a different outcome, the law prevails.
      </p>

      <h2>Chargebacks</h2>
      <p>
        Please contact us first if something is wrong — most issues (a broken
        download link, a technical problem) can be resolved quickly without a
        dispute.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
